Always use `--reporter=line` to avoid interactive HTML report server.

## Essential Commands
```bash
# Standard run
npx playwright test --reporter=line

# Single test  
npx playwright test tests/e2e/specific.spec.ts --reporter=line

# Debug (headed)
npx playwright test tests/e2e/specific.spec.ts --headed --reporter=line
```
## Never Use
- `npx playwright test` (starts server)
- `npx playwright test --ui` (interactive mode)